    "created_at": "2016-10-15T22:59:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-15T23:02:04Z",
    "body": "Maybe best would be if https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#prescan-a-byte-stream-to-determine-its-encoding looked for the BOMs first (before the loop) and bailed out then. It duplicates things a bit, but seems less invasive.\n\nEdit: no, that would allow the transport-layer encoding to override the BOM, which is incorrect. Nevermind. It would have to be in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#encoding-sniffing-algorithm if we want to do it that way.\n",
